  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_7998.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Nubes de Az&uacute;car, en la avenida Montendre, 9-esquina calle R&iacute;o Mijares de Onda, organiza para los jueves de vacaciones de Pascua talleres infantiles de cupackes, de una hora y media de duraci&oacute;n. Ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as de 6 a 12 a&ntilde;os se divierten mientras elaboran los dulces.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/TallerInfantilCupcakesNubesAzucar090415.jpg\" style=\"height: 493px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El primero, al que corresponden las 10 fotos de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes, ha sido el 2 de abril y este jueves, d&iacute;a 9, hay programado otro, de 11 a 12.30 horas. La reserva se puede realizar en el tel&eacute;fono m&oacute;vil 617 87 52 48, tambi&eacute;n por whastapp.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7988.jpg\" alt=\"img_7988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7989.jpg\" alt=\"img_7989\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7990.jpg\" alt=\"img_7990\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7992.jpg\" alt=\"img_7992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7993.jpg\" alt=\"img_7993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7994.jpg\" alt=\"img_7994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7998.jpg\" alt=\"img_7998\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_7999.jpg\" alt=\"img_7999\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_8002.jpg\" alt=\"img_8002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/img_8003.jpg\" alt=\"img_8003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubsazucar020415/tallerinfantilcupcakesnubesazucar090415.jpg\" alt=\"tallerinfantilcupcakesnubesazucar090415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
